sequenceDiagram
  actor Shopper
  participant C as BgeAiProductController
  participant S as BgeSemanticProductSearchService
  participant Client as BgeEmbeddingClient
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Model as BGE model
  participant JDBC as JdbcTemplate
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Shopper->>C: GET /ai/bge/products/search
  C->>S: search(query, limit, category, price filters)
  S->>Client: generateQueryEmbedding
  Client->>API: POST /v1/embeddings input_type=query
  API->>Model: Encode retrieval-prefixed query
  Model-->>API: Normalized 384D vector
  API-->>Client: Embedding response
  Client-->>S: Query vector
  S->>JDBC: Similarity query + filters
  JDBC->>DB: Search vectors and product records
  DB-->>JDBC: Ranked rows
  JDBC-->>S: Product candidates
  S-->>C: Search response DTOs
  C-->>Shopper: JSON result
